OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused put money in dead
OL,4,Awoman's account
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FThe jury in the trial of a man accused
OL,10,Fof murdering a woman has been shown
OL,11,Ffootage of him going into a bank to put
OL,12,Fmoney into her account while she was
OL,13,Fdead in a freezer at his home.
OL,15,FGeorge Gordon was captured on CCTV
OL,16,Fgoing into a bank in St Helens on 8
OL,17,FJanuary this year, the same day police
OL,18,Fwent to Delia McInerney's home in
OL,19,FLiverpool to look for her.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
