OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool Crown Court heard Gordon had
OL,7,Ftold police "she's in the freezer" when
OL,8,Fthey went to his home in Gerard's Court
OL,9,Fin St Helens after failing to find her
OL,10,Fat her own house.
